# 2026-08-15 19:37:29.969765
+Create a new component: artifacts/sovereign/src/pages/SearchPage.tsx.
+
+This page is used when a user clicks "Create Message" from the bottom navigation and then selects either "Regular Message" or "Deal Card".
+
+The page receives a query parameter `type` which can be either `message` or `deal`.
+
+Behavior:
+- It should show a search input at the top.
+- When the user types at least 2 characters, it should query the `profiles` table in Supabase to find users matching the search query (username or display_name).
+- Display the search results as a list. Each result should show: avatar, display_name, and username.
+- When a user clicks on a result:
+  - If `type === 'message'`, navigate to the regular message composer with that user selected.
+  - If `type === 'deal'`, navigate to the DealCardComposer with that user selected (or open a page to send a deal card).
+- For now, just navigate to the respective pages and pass the user ID. We will handle the actual composer later.
+
+Also, in App.tsx, add a route for /search to render this new SearchPage.
+
+Remove the mock search from Dashboard.tsx. In Dashboard, when the user clicks the search tab, navigate to /search instead. You can remove the search section from Dashboard entirely.

